A utilitiy to help faultfind a Diverecorder network.   Esentally a UDP monitor recording the packets sent by DiveRecorder on the four ports.   The utility can also decode the packet 'assuming its from diverecorder' and also has a simple scoreboard.  The monitor has a very simple metrics window which looks at the UPDATE and REFEREE packets and reports thir state.  This assumes that DR sends 3 packets per message which is thew case for all Diverecorder versions in the last few years.  Older versions may send more than 3 in which case the metrics will be wrong.  The visulisation on the main screen has a pie chart that expects a max of 12, thus easy to visulise as it follows the clock face!.     
